00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:04.560
{Opening}

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.440
<i>{emo}There's no way I could've known about this ending.</i>

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.470
Shit! The head! Aim for the head!{Vert changed from 158 to 000-no TV scroll -A0}

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.350
Dammit! Who the hell let these things on?!

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.520
The First Lady has been bitten!

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:24.400
Mr. President! Please enter the code!

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.660
But...

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.900
You and I have both been bitten!

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:29.760
Please listen.

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:33.280
We don't even have anywhere to land!

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:40.600
This is why we must suppress every country that is pointing ICBMs at the USA while we still can!

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:46.420
Aside from officially announcing National State of Emergency Tactical Regulation 666D,

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:51.160
we have no way of fulfilling our duty to both the Constitution and the people!{"constitution" capitalized -A0}

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:56.440
Mr. Chairman!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.950
I'm done for.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.100
Someone, please...

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.400
Yes sir!

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.050
Mr. President...

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:15.210
The code...

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.040
God... bless...{both lines w/the pause too}

