Row, row, row your boat{Top to Default-no TV scroll -A0}

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.610
La la la la{Top to Default-no TV scroll -A0}

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.690
Gently down the stream{Top to Default-no TV scroll -A0}

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.390
I can even sing in English.{Top to Default-no TV scroll -A0}

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.950
Wow! Try singing it.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.910
Okay, this time, I'll sing a parody.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:52.610
Okay.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.960
Wow, Kouta-chan!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:09.500
Hey, fatty!

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:11.900
Don't teach kids inappropriate songs!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:14.600
That song is from Mother Goose, you know!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.080
Kaaay.{added}

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.380
Guys, wake up!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.180
It's about time we crossed the river.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:41.440
There's no one here.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.310
Living or otherwise.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:50.330
What?!

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.950
I bet you're enjoying that.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.010
What? Huh?

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.140
Uhm, Saeko-san.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.680
You're drooling.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:06.550
Let's get out.

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:07.770
Why?

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.820
Er, well, the sun is up.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.600
I thought you'd wanna get changed...

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.080
Komuro, come help me.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:21.010
Let's get Alice-chan down.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.770
Uhm... Uhm...

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:29.210
My undies...

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.250
This is why men...

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:35.720
Look, we're going to be changing, so don't you dare look over here!

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.620
So, she's...?

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:42.110
Maresato Alice-chan.

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.510
She's a 2nd grade student.

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.920
Her father is a newspaper reporter.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.430
Er, rather, he was.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.450
What about her mother?

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.720
Her father said they'd meet up with her later.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:00.180
I brought my friend's clothes with us.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.560
You can wear whatever you like.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.600
Can I wear this jacket?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:05.820
Of course!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.860
Are there no other skirts besides this one?

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.060
Isn't it sexy?

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.510
Time to take one for the team, Komuro!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.060
I said I don't wanna die!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:19.980
He's always so hyper.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.320
Hey, don't bark too much, Zeke.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:23.850
Zeke?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.330
That's his name.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.870
Zeke was the nickname the American army gave the Reisen during the Pacific War.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:30.860
Reisen?

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:32.180
Oh, the Zero fighter plane.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:35.820
You really are small and fast. It's a fitting name.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.360
Use this, Komuro.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.770
It's a shotgun, so just aim for the head.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:44.300
Like I said before, I don't know how to use it.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.020
I'd be better off with a bat.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:48.150
After you shove the shotshells in,

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:55.550
get your target in sight, press the trigger, and blow off their head.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:59.400
Just stick to hitting things that're nearby, since you haven't had any practice.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.970
What do I do when I run out?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.890
Open the gate like this

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.650
and push them in like so.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.060
Normally, it holds four shells plus one shell in the chamber.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.930
Only five total can be in at a time, so use them wisely.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.330
Aside from that, another peculiar thing about this gun is—

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.490
I'll need to hear it more than once to understand.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:20.860
But you should keep in mind that the recoil is strong.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.330
If I have to, I'll use it like a bat.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.310
This is to help you survive!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.050
I know.

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.600
Onii-chan!{Italics removed -A0}

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:34.640
What's up?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.660
What? Gotta problem?

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.650
No, you look good.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.110
But uh, do you know how to fire that thing?

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:58.170
Hirano can teach me.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:00.520
If I have to, I'll use it like a spear.

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:02.290
Youcanyoucanyoucan!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.630
We have a military-use bayonet device!

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.620
We're going up in the Humvee!

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.980
You two men, go see if it's safe!

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:10.610
YES MA'AM!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:21.130
Clear.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:22.830
It's okay!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.320
Shizuka-sensei.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.880
Here we go!

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.970
The Rat Patrooo—

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:43.570
Is this Tunisia?

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:48.200
It doesn't look like they tried to block the river.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:52.150
As the news broadcast said, it is like this
 all throughout the world.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:55.240
But I'm sure there are some police officers left.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:59.680
Right. Japan's police officers are all about their work.

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.630
Yeah!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.880
What do we do now?

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.750
Takagi, aren't you from Higashiosaka 2-chome?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:07.890
Yeah.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:11.150
Then Takagi's house is the closest.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.350
But, uhm...

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.020
Yeah, I know...

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.400
I'm not expecting anything.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:20.370
But, I still want to—{"..." to "—" -A0}

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.210
Of course you do.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.780
There's so many big bikes!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.580
They sell stuff like imported buggies there.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.020
Some of them are old military surplus.{"were trashed by the military" to "are old military surplus" for clarity =A0}

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.930
Why do you know all of this?

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:55.770
What's wrong?

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.500
We haven't seen any helicopters or airplanes.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.700
But yesterday, we saw so many of them.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.440
Everything will be all right, won't it?{re-interpret?}

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.220
Yeah, definitely.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.550
Hey, Takashi. Did you notice?

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:13.640
Notice what?

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.150
We...

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.330
We haven't seen any of <i>them</i> today.{Italics added -A0}

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:21.320
That's true.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:10:59.370
It's <i>them</i>!{Italics added -A0}

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:03.570
Ahead and to the right! Distance: 300!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.610
Turn right!

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:06.970
Okay!

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:11.970
<i>They</i>'re here too! Jeez!{Italics added -A0}

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.260
Then turn left! Left!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.070
What the...

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.590
We're seeing more and more of <i>them</i> as we get closer to Higashiosaka 2-chome.{Italics added -A0}

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:23.290
But why? There must be a reason why!

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.230
Keep up the speed and push <i>them</i> aside!{Italics added -A0}

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:34.260
No!

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.370
Don't!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.570
Stop!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.900
A wire is affixed to the walls!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.390
Turn the car to the side!

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.350
Don't look!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.140
Why won't it stop?!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.430
The tires are locked!{"Lock the tires!" changed to "The tires are locked!" -A0}

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:55.020
Just ease up a little on the brake and step on the gas!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:56.850
Lock?

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:03.400
Hey, Sensei!

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.070
Up front! The front!

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.170
Open the slide...

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:50.590
Aim for the head...

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.630
Takashi?

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:53.740
And fire!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.310
What? But I aimed for the head!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.050
I didn't hit many of <i>them</i>!{Italics added -A0}

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.080
You're a lousy shot!

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:07.250
The recoil's raising your muzzle,
 and your fire pattern's slipping upwards!

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:10.440
Hold the gun straight and aim at their chest!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.690
Hold the gun straight...

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:16.310
Aim at their chest...

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.110
And fire!

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:20.830
Whoa, cool.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.680
But there's too many of <i>them</i>...{Italics added -A0}

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.350
After firing a shot,

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.100
leave the trigger and just open the slide!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.540
The muzzle shifts a little!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.600
This owns!

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:42.930
Crap, bullets!

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:46.000
Shit!

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.270
Komuro-kun!

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.140
I shall assist you!

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.550
Take this opportunity to rescue Miyamoto-kun!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:51.750
No way!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:54.230
There's too many of <i>them</i> for you to fight with a wooden sword!{Italics added -A0}

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.120
I know that!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.880
Dammit!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.260
Well, at least we can die together.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:22.840
Takashi?

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.060
I got it...

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:32.130
Sorry!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.390
Hirano! How do I use this?

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:38.390
Push the lever in front of the trigger guard!

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:41.330
Then disengage the safety!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.460
After, pull the operating rod on the right side!

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:46.060
And shoot!

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:21.810
Missed!

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:24.910
Missed!

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:25.930
Missed!

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:29.080
My magazine!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.390
Someone get me one of these from the back!

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:33.730
Kouta-chan?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:34.860
This!

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:42.030
Kouta-chan!

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:43.960
Here!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.650
Time to kill!

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:53.080
I'll kill 'em all!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:58.860
What the? The engine's stalled and I can't start it!

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:01.550
What're you doing, Takagi-san?!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:04.040
I'm going to pick up Komuro's gun and use it!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:05.760
Th-That's dangerous!{"T-That" to "Th-That" -A0}

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.930
Yes, I know, Sensei.{added "Sensel" -A0}

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.310
Takagi-san!

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:14.830
The bullets are by your feet! Do you know how to use it?

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.680
I'm a genius!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:17.770
Takagi?

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.790
In the future, call me by my first name!

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.780
I'm... not a coward!

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:36.350
I'm not a coward!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.340
I'm not gonna die!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:41.800
None of us are gonna die here!

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:46.890
My house is just around the corner!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:27.810
Zeke!

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.110
Komuro!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.590
Come on. Let a man do his thing.

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:52.830
What're you going to do?

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:56.930
Copy Zeke.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.600
Komuro-kun! I'm right behind you!{"Come with me, Komuro-kun!" to "Komuro-kun! I'm right behind you!" for clarity -A0}

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.150
Here!

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:24.240
Here!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:26.420
Over here!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:30.230
Komuro-kun!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:31.520
Up here!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.500
Come on! We're right here!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.020
Hurry up and follow us!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:49.560
They are still...?

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:53.590
I SAID COME OVER HERE!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.870
Here you go.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.430
Kouta-chan...?

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.940
You and Zeke need to jump to the other side of the wire!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.300
But what about everyone else?

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.000
We'll be there shortly!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:10.610
Liar!{"." to "!" -A0}

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:11.220
Huh?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.820
You have the same face my papa had when he died!{"daddy" to "papa" -A0}

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.610
He died even though he said he was okay!

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.770
No! No! No!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:23.400
I don't wanna be alone!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:28.070
I wanna be with you and
Takashi-oniichan and the girls forever!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.580
Forever and ever and ever!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.050
Don't leave me alone!

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:34.100
Please!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:40.810
Please!

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:56.310
I don't know why I think of you Never ever feel it as today

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:01.230
I don't know what you pray for when you're alone

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:05.760
I don't know where we'll go tomorrow Never ever lose the way for you

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:10.830
I'll know the reason of that we are still here

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:12.620
Take me high

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.750
Floating like a kite

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:17.090
Gently make me free

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:20.430
Holding a thousand dreams

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:25.530
Nagareru Kumo wa Ne Doko e Yuku no

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:25.530
Hey, where are the clouds drifting to?

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:25.530
流れる雲は　ねぇ　どこへ行くの？

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:26.740
What do you want?

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.270
What do you see?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:29.960
Mirai wa

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:29.960
The future

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:29.960
未来は

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.360
Sono Mama Taiyo Sae

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.360
As things are, even the sun

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.360
そのまま太陽さえ

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:35.770
Nomikonde Shimau Kedo

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:35.770
will be get swallowed up

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:35.770
呑み込んでしまうけど

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.290
Demo Kamawanai

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.290
But that doesn't bother me

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.290
でも構わない

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:44.410
'Cause we will be there again

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:50.120
I'll always be with you

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:15.060
No! No! No!

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:17.020
Don't leave me alone!

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:19.100
Please!

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:20.990
Please!

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:27.710
Everyone, duck!

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:44.140
They're... saved...

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.160
Come this way immediately.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:50.240
You can pick up that car later.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.040
Who are they?

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.040
I do not believe they are really from the fire department.

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:03.480
Thanks for rescuing us when we were in danger!

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:05.500
It's only natural...

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:13.410
For a mother to help her daughter and her friends.

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:14.950
Mom!

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.220
That's Takagi's mom!

00:22:24.100 --> 00:22:25.480
They're saved!

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:29.860
Our situation, on the other hand, does not bode well.

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:32.110
I do not believe they will come help us.

00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:35.410
Let's take a detour. I know my way around this area.

00:22:37.130 --> 00:22:38.370
Takashi...

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:43.080
Kouta-chan?

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:44.790
Don't worry.

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:49.670
Busujima-sempai is strong,
 and Komuro is one stubborn guy.

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.020
We'll be waiting!

00:22:55.060 --> 00:23:01.860
We'll be waiting at my house!

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:08.320
<i>{emo}Despite the situation we found ourselves in,</i>

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>{emo}I kept my head held high.</i>

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:16.530
<i>{emo}Because after all of the fights and fighting,</i>

00:23:18.140 --> 00:23:20.170
<i>{emo}we were still alive.</i>

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:26.910
Let's get back.

00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:28.020
I... I am a woman!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.540
Uh, yes!

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:32.000
There is a man I like.

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:33.980
Saeko!

00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:35.110
Of course!
